@yyc-jnu/dsh-skill-invocation-monitor README · What changes after you install it：- the sidebar gains a **技能监控 / Skill Monitor** entry, with a live badge showing how many calls are running;
- the panel lists every live Agent, and under each one every skill call with its **status** and **elapsed time**;
- **both** ways a skill can be reached are covered and told apart — the model calling the `skill` tool, and
  **you** triggering a skill yourself, which carries a `用户触发` badge on its row;
- nothing is written anywhere: no tool registered, no session state touched, no call intercepted or delayed.

@yyc-jnu/dsh-skill-invocation-monitor README · or straight from GitHub (plain ESM JavaScript: no build step, so pnpm never asks for allowBuilds)：Uninstall:sh
dsh plugin --profile web remove @yyc-jnu/dsh-skill-invocation-monitor
```

@yyc-jnu/dsh-skill-invocation-monitor README · How it works：<details>
<summary><b>The two invocation paths</b> — and why the human one is read from a message source</summary>

A skill can be reached two structurally different ways in DSH, and the plugin observes both.

@yyc-jnu/dsh-skill-invocation-monitor README · How it works：The human path is read from the structured source the skills seam itself attaches
(`SkillInvocationSource`, in the persistence catalog):

```json
{ "type": "user/message", "data": {
    "source": { "kind": "skill-invocation", "name": "grill-me", "form": "instructions" },
    "role": "user", "id": "7c2e0f5a-3b9d-4e18-9a6c-1d2f3a4b5c6d" } }
```

@yyc-jnu/dsh-skill-invocation-monitor README · Introduction：> 一个**只读**的 [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)（DSH）插件，把技能调用摊在一屏里：
> 当前有哪些 Agent 在跑、每个正在调用哪个 Skill、是运行中 / 已完成 / 失败、已经跑了多久——在 Web GUI 侧边栏实时可见。

*取自运行中的插件：点侧边栏入口打开面板，每个 Agent 一组，每一行是一次技能调用（状态、时长、起始时刻）。*

@yyc-jnu/dsh-skill-invocation-monitor README · 致谢：本插件的代码在 **AI 辅助下完成**：作者提出需求、评估并验收结果，AI 负责实现与文档。所有行为都在真实
DSH 运行环境中逐项验证过；测试与文档中出现的会话标题、消息 id、时间戳等**全部为合成值**，不含任何
真实用户数据。
